This helper prints a delivery run sheet. With three stops it prints three lines and then throws.

```js
function runSheet(stops) {
  const lines = [];
  for (let i = 0; i <= stops.length; i += 1) {
    lines.push(`${i + 1}. ${stops[i].address}`);
  }
  return lines;
}
```

What exactly goes wrong, and what is the minimal fix?

